# Focus Garden

> A productivity-focused timer that turns focused work sessions into a growing virtual garden.

## Overview

Focus Garden is a productivity application designed to help users stay focused and build consistent work habits.

The app combines a focused work timer with simple gamification. Users can complete focused sessions, grow virtual plants, earn rewards, and build a visual garden as they stay consistent with their work.

The project was built to make focused work sessions feel more engaging while keeping the experience simple and distraction-free.

## Features

- Focus timer for distraction-free work sessions
- Multiple plant and tree options
- Plants grow as focused sessions are completed
- Different task modes for different types of work
- Virtual coin/reward system
- Progress tracking
- Gamified productivity experience
- Responsive interface for different screen sizes
- Simple and focused user experience

## How It Works

Choose a Task
     ↓
Start a Focus Session
     ↓
Stay Focused
     ↓
Complete the Session
     ↓
Earn Rewards
     ↓
Grow Your Garden
